","x":1585,"y":1602,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"따라서","x":1720,"y":1602,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"선","x":1834,"y":1604,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"보다는 채널로 링크를 더 추상화해서 고려할 수 있다. 이더넷 랜(그림 6.15)에 대한 설","words":[{"text":"보다는","x":538,"y":1663,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"채널로","x":652,"y":1664,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"링크를","x":766,"y":1664,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"더","x":877,"y":1664,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"추상화해서","x":921,"y":1662,"width":162,"height":39},{"text":"고려할","x":1100,"y":1662,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1214,"y":1662,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1265,"y":1662,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"이더넷","x":1359,"y":1662,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"랜(그림","x":1481,"y":1662,"width":117,"height":39},{"text":"6.15)에","x":1618,"y":1662,"width":120,"height":39},{"text":"대한","x":1756,"y":1662,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"설","x":1834,"y":1664,"width":27,"height":37}]},{"text":"명에서 상호연결하는 매체가 실제로는 다소 복잡한 스위치 기반구조일 수 있음-을 보았","words":[{"text":"명에서","x":541,"y":1725,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"상호연결하는","x":651,"y":1725,"width":199,"height":38},{"text":"매체가","x":862,"y":1725,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"실제로는","x":973,"y":1724,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"다소","x":1119,"y":1723,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"복잡한","x":1197,"y":1723,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"스위치","x":1315,"y":1723,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"기반구조일","x":1438,"y":1723,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1632,"y":1724,"width":39,"height":37},{"text":"있음-을","x":1686,"y":1722,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"보았","x":1801,"y":1725,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"다. 그러나 이러한 전개에서 호스트는 상호연결히는 매체가 단순히 둘 이상의 호스트","words":[{"text":"다.","x":540,"y":1786,"width":40,"height":37},{"text":"그러나","x":597,"y":1786,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"이러한","x":713,"y":1786,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"전개에서","x":826,"y":1786,"width":126,"height":38},{"text":"호스트는","x":971,"y":1786,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"